        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur NEWSGR, Newport Series Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe elegant rope styling captured by the Newport S Grip Handleset has been a favorite of homeowners for centuries. The historic design rope detailing is reminiscent of European architectural elements. Fashioned from solid, premium-grade brass it has a lifetime mechanical warranty. Grandeur door locks include features such as spring assisted inside trim to make them robust. This high quality solid forged brass entry set includes a high security deadbolt. This handleset fits doors 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy or single cylinder handlesets in a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-newport-series\"><b>Newport Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur NEWSGR Newport S Grip Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur Newport Series Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Height: 3.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2.56\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Width: 2.56\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Length: 2.03\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Width: 1.02\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Height: 17.08\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\" with optional thick door kit for doors up to 2-1/2\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Distance: minimum 4-3/8\" center to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-handleset.pdf?v=1704262176\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur Handleset Exploded View (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/NEWSGR-handleset.pdf?v=1704262177\" target=\"new\"><b>Newport S-Grip Handleset Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the lever operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset is does not function--neither locking nor latching.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note:</b> Inside trim levers are handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to determine left or right handed.</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Newport S Grip Handleset, Grandeur NEWSGR",
                "description": "Grandeur NEWSGR, Newport Series Handleset - The elegant rope styling captured by the Newport S Grip Handleset has been a favorite of homeowners for centuries. The historic design rope detailing is reminiscent of European architectural elements. Fashioned from solid, premium-grade brass it has a lifetime mechanical warranty. Grandeur door locks include features such as spring assisted inside trim to make them robust. This high quality solid forged brass entry set includes a high security deadbolt. This handleset fits doors 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy or single cylinder handlesets in a wide array of finishes.",
                "keywords": "GRA-NEWSGR, Grandeur NEWSGR, Newport S Grip Handlesets, Grandeur Newport Series Handleset, Rope Handlesets, traditional handlesets, dummy handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double handlesets, Newport handlesets,"
